# BloomOS Translation Progress

## Overview

BloomOS is currently undergoing branding and translation review as part of the migration from LineageOS.

This repository contains translated resources inherited from upstream LineageOS. Each language is being reviewed manually to replace user-visible references to LineageOS, CyanogenMod, websites, contributor references, legal references, and other project-specific branding.

